# CV Generation Pipeline

The master CV is stored as JSON.

The job description and master CV are fed into an LLM to reduce the master CV experience to only those which are most relevant to the job description and to re-order the skills and experience to be most relevant to the job description.

The reduced CV is then fed into a LaTeX template to generate a PDF CV.

## Usage

```bash
python scripts/generate_latex.py
```

